WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:50.580
HYUNCKEL VERSUS HADLAR

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:07.560
Hyunckel... you're alive?!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.850
You...

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.600
Is this a dream? Or am I dead?

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.380
You're not dreaming. And you're not dead.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:36.720
Hyunckel!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:37.880
Maam.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.340
You're alive! You...

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.590
Thank goodness!

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:52.160
Hey, Hyunckel!
I'm wounded over here! Help me out!

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.400
Have some medicinal herbs.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:59.900
That bastard!
What happened to equal treatment?!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.670
Explain this to me.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:06.910
You were supposed to have died
with the fall of the Underground Palace.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.410
That's right. I should have.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:14.540
But I was saved
at the brink of death by one man.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.170
<i>Truly, at the brink of death!</i>

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.350
<i>So you survived...</i>

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.020
...Crocodine.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:38.150
My steel body is my one defining trait.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:41.800
Plus your servants patched me up well.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:45.410
I was barely alive
when this Garuda saved me.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:51.000
I was the one who tried to kill you.
Why save me?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:55.190
It was a warrior's mercy
that you ordered my treatment.

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:58.250
Mercy must be repaid in kind.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:04.130
Besides, you must continue
to help Dai and his friends from now on.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:09.830
If mercy was your intent,
you should have let me die.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:10.560
Hm?

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.250
I ignored my own weakness

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:18.520
and turned my hate to my master, Avan,
and towards humanity.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.990
My death would have
at least made up for my crimes!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:26.240
Now, I have to live on in my shame!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:29.700
Hyunckel.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:36.120
I believe the worth of a man lies in
how much they can let go of the past.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:41.480
Be it a life in shame, hated by all,

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:45.340
so long as you walk the path you believe,
isn't that enough?

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:50.470
The Garuda tells me Dai
and his friends have headed north.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:52.890
Probably to Valge Island.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.450
I'm going to go help them.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:05:00.960
It's the least I can do after they
reminded me of a warrior's honor.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.230
Wait!

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:10.160
You're right. My crimes aren't so small
that my death absolves them!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:15.910
And you and Maam were the first people
to ever shed tears for me.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:20.900
In order to repay those tears,
I must... I must...

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.840
I must continue to fight!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.380
What's that?!

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.370
The Dark Armour Blade?!

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:35.930
It was lost in the fall of
the Underground Palace! How is it here?!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.250
And it's completely restored!

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.610
They say a true weapon
chooses its wielder.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:48.530
Perhaps this Dark Blade was drawn here
by your renewed Aura.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:52.740
Amdo!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.800
That's it!

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:12.220
So long as you have the will to fight,
that armour shall never die!

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.480
Thank you, Beast King!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.460
Unbelievable!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:26.380
I never trusted you, but for Crocodine
to betray us and join Dai!

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:30.910
You'll believe it when you hear him
destroy the Dark Flame Spire.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.890
Maam, can you stand?

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:34.660
Yes.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.620
Leave this to me.
Head to Valge Tower with Popp.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.420
Dai should be on his way there.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.340
Yes, but...

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:48.470
Well, okay then! Thanks!
Best of luck to you!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.110
What are you doing, Popp?!

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:53.180
Forget him! He said go, so we're going!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.600
<i>Like I'll let him touch you
a second longer!</i>

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:09.900
Traitors must die!
That's the law of the Dark Army!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.240
I'll make your death slow and painful!

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.080
Now, how do you want to die?!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.640
Hadlar, are you looking down on me?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.420
Or are you too stupid to tell
how strong your opponents are?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.630
What?

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:38.410
These scrubs aren't worth my time!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:42.770
If you want to kill me,
do it by risking your own life!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:46.770
Y-You brat!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:59.040
Don't let him any closer
to the Dark Flame Spire!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.040
Get back, old man!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.500
Beast King Anguish Blast!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.510
No! The Dark Flame Spire!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:31.530
I feel lighter! The Curse Field is gone!

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:35.030
What an astounding attack!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:40.910
But "Anguish Blast"
sounds a little too ominous.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.710
Why don't you call it,
"Beast King Redemption Blast"?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.840
That's not half bad! Thanks, old man!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:57.360
Oh, man. After all that trouble,
there goes my Curse Field.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:00.060
What is Master Hadlar doing?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:07.190
The Dark Flame Spire has fallen.
It's your turn now.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.210
Lord Hadlar!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:14.440
Stay back, all of you!
I'll show him my true power!

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:18.470
I'm no longer worthy
to call Avan, "Master."

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:21.790
To claim to avenge my master
would be impudent.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:26.830
However, for taking the life
of my father, Bartos,

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.420
I cannot allow you to live!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.090
You snotty whelp! Watch your tongue!

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:35.760
Like father, like son, you both defy me!

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:38.130
Begone!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.330
Impossible! My Kaboom spell...?!

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:54.150
Have you forgotten?
My armour repels all attack spells.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.530
Prepare yourself, Hadlar!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:02.330
Die!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.670
There's nothing in this world
my Hell's Claws can't penetrate!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.550
Good! That's more like it!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:22.890
Dai!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.350
Popp! Maam!

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.790
It was Hyunckel! Hyunckel saved us!

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.980
Talk about an oasis in a desert!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:36.530
That's great! So Hyunckel
is a Disciple of Avan after all!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.110
I'm sure Master Avan must be proud.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.930
Let's go! To save Leona!

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:44.990
Right!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.960
<i>Be careful, Hyunckel.</i>

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:59.800
They're evenly matched!
No, Lord Hadlar seems at a disadvantage!

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:08.430
<i>He's not the Dark Commander for nothing!
He has the power to back it!</i>

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:13.710
<i>He's stronger than I imagined!
No wonder Dark King Vearn likes him!</i>

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:17.150
<i>And without my spells,
I'm at a disadvantage!</i>

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.860
<i>If I can do something about that armour...</i>

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.200
<i>I see...</i>

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.870
<i>He's coming for the final showdown!</i>

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.250
Bloody Scryde!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.300
That was rather disappointing.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.640
It's over, Hadlar.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:45.860
No!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:48.180
Lord Hadlar lost?!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:01.650
Impossible! How can you move
with your vitals pierced?!

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:05.910
Unfortunately for you, I have a heart
on both sides of my chest.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.240
I was waiting for you to lower your sword!

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:14.500
Now let me fill your armour
with my flames of hell!

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.710
Kafrizz!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.470
Hyunckel...

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.560
BLOODY SCRYDE

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.570
FIVE FINGER FLARES

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.720
How do you like my flames?
Agonizing, aren't they?

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:53.460
They won't go out
until your body is burned away!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.960
Curse you and your dirty tricks!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:06.510
<i>I can't... I can't move my body!</i>

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:09.490
So much for your mighty sword.

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:13.220
Meanwhile, I still have my secret weapon!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:19.310
Now watch as I unleash the full power
of my greatest spell!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:23.570
Can your punctured armour withstand it?!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.130
Take this!

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.320
Kasizz!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.630
I've won!

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:50.390
Stubborn little brat! He's finally dead!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.200
Lord Hadlar has won!

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.990
Lord Hadlar, are you hurt?

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:58.520
It's nothing.
I merely lost one of my hearts.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.920
Is this all that survived?

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:02.730
Yes, Lord!

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:07.030
Good! We're going after Dai
and we'll slaughter them all!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:07.950
Yes, Lord!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.550
<i>No! Dai and the others are in danger!</i>

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:16.720
<i>I have to stop them!</i>

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:20.710
<i>But I don't have any way to fight!</i>

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:25.270
<i>What can I do? What weapon can I use?!</i>

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:26.550
<i>Life itself.</i>

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.380
<i>Avan?!</i>

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.680
Life energy. Basically, your Aura.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.270
What is this attack?!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.360
I just focused my Aura.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.260
As a Warrior, you cannot cast spells.

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:54.990
If your sword is lost,
the only weapon left is life itself.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.790
In such a situation, use your life energy.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.430
In other words, you fight with your Aura.

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:02.730
My Aura...

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:09.300
But an Aura is offensive life energy.
It's very, very difficult to control.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:15.140
If your heart is full of malice,
it can put your own life at risk.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.450
I don't need such a skill.

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:24.520
All I have to do is defeat my enemy
with my sword, right?

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:29.780
<i>Back then, I laughed at Avan's teachings.</i>

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.740
<i>But now, I understand.</i>

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.080
<i>Now I know I can do it!</i>

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:40.810
It's almost impressive how stubborn
the Students of Avan can be.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.790
Wait a minute, Lord Hadlar!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.790
We can take a half-dead enemy like him!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.760
<i>Huh? Has he given up?</i>

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:03.480
<i>What is that? An extreme amount of energy
is gathering at Hyunckel's forehead!</i>

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.270
<i>Wait, is this... his Aura?!</i>

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:11.990
<i>If it means stopping Hadlar here,
then I'll gladly use all of my life!</i>

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:19.950
<i>Avan, my master! Give this ungrateful
student his final strength!</i>

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.750
N-No! Get away!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.380
Grand Cross!

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.200
Dai, that light!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.280
Yeah!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.760
What is it, you two?

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.690
It's just like back then.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:49.150
<i>The light from when Master Avan
fought Hadlar and died!</i>

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.900
Megante!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.120
It was just like that.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:09.440
Like the final flash of life itself.

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.750
No...!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.400
Hey! Where are you going, Dai?!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:18.510
Where do you think?! To go help Hyunckel!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:23.120
Hold on!
We don't know if that was him or not!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:29.190
Besides, he can't use spells!
He can't cast Megante and die!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:34.150
But that's no ordinary light!
Win or lose, he won't be alright!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.260
Isn't that right, Maam?!

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:39.570
What are you thinking?!
What about Princess Leona?!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.590
There's still time until sundown!

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:44.290
Stop it! There's nothing you can do now!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.100
No! At the very least, I have to go!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:48.370
You can't, Dai!

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:53.420
We're going to Valge Tower! We have to!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.970
Why?! Are you abandoning Hyunckel?!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:59.050
That's what he wants!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:05.270
Hyunckel and Crocodine
came here to help us.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.650
It's all so you can save Princess Leona!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:15.360
If you turn back now, all they've done,
their very lives will be for nothing!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.780
Besides, Hyunckel is a Disciple of Avan.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:27.140
He'd risk his life to save his friends
no matter what!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.670
Just as our Master did!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:37.440
<i>They're strong... They're so strong,
both Hyunckel and Maam.</i>

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:38.670
<i>I can't compete...</i>

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:40.840
All right, Maam.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:45.220
Right now, our purpose is
to save Leona as soon as possible!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.890
Let's go! The tower is right there!

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:56.630
<i>Hyunckel, Crocodine, thank you!
I promise I'll save Leona!</i>

00:18:56.630 --> 00:19:00.490
<i>So please, please don't die out there!</i>

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.960
I somehow managed to withstand it.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.000
How lucky I had these minions
to use as shields.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:23.430
Is this the power
of that Grand Cross attack?

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.640
What terrifying power!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.060
Hyunckel!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.490
I see.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:48.870
I get it now!
Grand Cross was an incomplete attack!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:54.210
As a result, it drew upon
all the Aura Hyunckel had!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:59.300
All that's remains is this soulless husk!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:08.060
After all your trouble, it looks like
I get the last laugh, Hyunckel!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:14.830
I'll just cleave your head off,
and massacre Dai and his friends,

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:18.900
and there'll be no one left in my way!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.820
You can grind your teeth in the afterlife!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:28.370
Along with Avan, Bartos,
and your friends that follow you!

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:31.620
<i>Avan...</i>

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.790
<i>Bartos...</i>

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.380
<i>Master!</i>

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:39.920
<i>Dad!</i>

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.470
This is the end! Die, Hyunckel!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.130
I-Impossible!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:03.650
<i>He had spent all of his Aura completely!</i>

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:15.790
<i>Even unconscious, he still retains
the last of his will to fight!</i>

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:20.340
<i>Well done, Hyunckel.
You are indeed, a true...</i>

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.460
<i>warrior...!</i>

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:41.190
Man, Master Hadlar is useless!

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:44.740
He can't even beat a few brats...

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:49.870
Oh well. I guess this means
Dai's head will be worth even more!

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:54.060
The Hero's Party that the Dark Army
working together couldn't beat.

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:59.080
If I obliterate them,
the more glory for me!

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.710
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.710
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:39.890
<i>Saved by Hyunckel and Crocodine,
Dai's party reaches Valge Tower at last.</i>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.520
<i>But again, they are at the mercy
of Flazzard's powerful attack.</i>

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:51.950
<i>When all hope seems lost, Dai
remembers the words of his master, Avan!</i>

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:55.660
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.040
<i>"The Final Avan Style Technique"</i>

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:00.160
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
